### 🧪 Notification System Testing Guide
### Make sure your backend is running on http://localhost:3000
### 
### 📝 SETUP: First run the testing seeder to create test data:
### npm run prisma:seed-testing
###
### This will create:
### - 5 test users (ADMIN001, MANAGER001, PLAYER001-003)
### - 5 test clubs with courts
### - 5 test tournaments
### - 13 test bookings
### - 10 test notifications
###
### ============================================
### 1. GET TEST DATA - Get IDs for testing
### ============================================

### Get all users (find ADMIN001, MANAGER001, PLAYER001-003)
GET http://localhost:3000/users

### Get all clubs (find Tennis Club São Paulo, etc.)
GET http://localhost:3000/clubs

### Get all courts (find Quadra Central, etc.)
GET http://localhost:3000/courts

### Get all tournaments (find Copa São Paulo de Tênis 2024, etc.)
GET http://localhost:3000/tournaments

### Get all bookings (find tournament and regular bookings)
GET http://localhost:3000/bookings

### Get all notifications (see existing test notifications)
GET http://localhost:3000/notifications

### ============================================
### 2. BASIC NOTIFICATION CRUD TESTS
### ============================================

### Create a basic notification
### Replace {{userId}} with actual user ID from the GET /users response
POST http://localhost:3000/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "cmh9tni400003a48bg64wf6hc",
  "type": "BOOKING_CONFIRMATION",
  "channel": "BOTH",
  "title": "Test Notification",
  "message": "This is a test notification message",
  "data": {
    "testKey": "testValue"
  }
}

### Get all notifications (should show existing test notifications)
GET http://localhost:3000/notifications

### ============================================
### 3. SPECIFIC NOTIFICATION TYPE TESTS
### ============================================

### Test Booking Confirmation Notification
### Replace {{userId}} and {{bookingId}} with actual IDs from GET responses
POST http://localhost:3000/notifications/booking-confirmation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "bookingId": "{{bookingId}}",
  "courtName": "Quadra Central",
  "startTime": "2024-12-15T09:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2024-12-15T10:30:00Z",
  "totalAmount": 150.00,
  "channel": "BOTH"
}

### Test Match Reminder Notification
### Replace {{userId}} and {{bookingId}} with actual IDs
POST http://localhost:3000/notifications/match-reminder
Content-Type: application/json

{
